.TH ANIM_FRAME 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
anim_frame \- The absolute sheet frame to draw right now: a\->first + st\->frame
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqsprite.h\(dq
.BI "int anim_frame(const AnimState *st, const Anim *a);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The absolute sheet frame to draw right now: a\->first + st\->frame. Pass the result to sprite_draw().
.SH RETURN VALUE
the frame index on the sheet.
.SH MODULE
sprite (src/engine/sprite/sprite.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR anim_step (3),
.BR sprite_draw (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
